cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use CosmicGrain, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "CosmicGrain"
abstract: >-
  A live dust physics extension for GADGET-4. Dust superparticles carry their own
  masses, grain sizes, compositions, positions and velocities, and follow dust
  creation, growth, coagulation, shattering, destruction and transport alongside
  gas, stars and dark matter in cosmological zoom simulations.
